src/archivede.rs and src/archivede/ are a Rust port derived from
archive_de.cpp in Aleksey Vaneev's BiteOpt repository
(https://github.com/avaneev/biteopt, commit e8d6785, 2026-10-09). From there
come the archive-gated DE/rand/1/bin, the exact online Pareto archive keyed by
the objective sum, and the survivor selection by objective champions, rank
sums and greedy rank-space spread. The port differs from that commit where
equal rounded objective sums can hide a dominance relation: such entries are
compared geometrically.

src/rankindex/ is a Rust port derived from two C++ programs that are not part
of the published BiteOpt repository: grid_point_index.cpp (the sparse uniform
grid in rank space, Copyright (c) 2026 Aleksey Vaneev) and
borda_box_query.cpp (the Borda rank-band box selector, which carries no
author notice). They were provided with the BiteOpt MIT license.

The Rust ports and their fcmaes adaptations are by Dietmar Wolz; Aleksey
Vaneev's copyright covers the original C++ code. Aleksey Vaneev was not
involved in the Rust ports. Both are distributed under:

